  "updated_at": "2026-03-17",
  "bio": "Kurt Stender is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in the vibrant and dynamic 'newschool' style, with an impressive tradition of delivering custom designs that astound his clientele. He operates out of Ridgefield Park, United States, maintaining a spotless and sanitary studio that underscores his commitment to cleanliness and the utmost professional standards in the tattooing industry. Clients seeking exceptional artistry in a hygienic setting will find Kurt's studio a perfect match for their needs.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Ridgefield Park, New Jersey, United States"
}